    <div class="story-copy">
      <p class="section-index">The short story</p>
      <h2>I spent years helping business owners build software.</h2>
      <p>I started Upstack Studio in 2017. My team and I built web and mobile products for real businesses. I learned that projects rarely fail because of code. They fail because people build the wrong thing or do not understand the customer well enough.</p>
      <p>Later, I closed the agency. I wanted to build my own products, own the results and focus on fewer, bigger bets.</p>
      <p>Today, I’m building Second Team, making other useful products over time and sharing the lessons while they are still fresh.</p>
